  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39499482",
      "title": "Enhancing the Demo App & Repeating Mutation Concepts",
      "sourceHash": "c2ddfc98fd8554b5bc9e11d8389cab014101f21a93a1439b50f4ff318b9ae776",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.7,
          "en": "Now to enhance this app a bit more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.7,
          "end": 5.73,
          "en": "and this details page specifically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.73,
          "end": 8.88,
          "en": "I now also want to add a little feature to this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.88,
          "end": 12.75,
          "en": "and to this page where we show some confirmation modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.75,
          "end": 16.95,
          "en": "before we actually trigger this deletion mutation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.95,
          "end": 20.04,
          "en": "So that if a user accidentally clicked on delete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.04,
          "end": 23.19,
          "en": "the deletion is not immediately initiated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.19,
          "end": 26.94,
          "en": "but we instead ask the user for confirmation first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.94,
          "end": 29.55,
          "en": "And this feature does now not require",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.55,
          "end": 33.18,
          "en": "any specific new React Query feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.18,
          "end": 35.52,
          "en": "Instead, it is something which we can build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.52,
          "end": 37.713,
          "en": "with our standard React knowledge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.97,
          "end": 42.63,
          "en": "Because here in the event details component, we can simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.63,
          "end": 46.8,
          "en": "start managing some state with the useState hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.8,
          "end": 49.74,
          "en": "And this could be some state that simply tells us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.74,
          "end": 54.74,
          "en": "whether the user started the deletion process or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.17,
          "end": 59.281,
          "en": "So I'll name my state variable here is deleting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.281,
          "end": 63.96,
          "en": "and the updating function set is deleting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.96,
          "end": 65.73,
          "en": "And initially that's false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.73,
          "end": 68.41,
          "en": "because initially we're not trying to delete this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.02,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "but I now wanna change this to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 76.09,
          "en": "once the user clicks this button, this delete button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.25,
          "end": 80.34,
          "en": "and then I want open up a modal where the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.34,
          "end": 85.023,
          "en": "has to click another button to actually start this mutation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.31,
          "end": 89.13,
          "en": "So I will add two new functions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.13,
          "end": 94.13,
          "en": "handle start delete in which I set is deleting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 95.55,
          "end": 100.55,
          "en": "to True and also handle stop delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 104.613,
          "en": "if the user cancels this process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105.47800000000001,
          "end": 107.493,
          "en": "where a set is deleting to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 109.2,
          "end": 111.39,
          "en": "And it's now handle start delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 111.39,
          "end": 116.193,
          "en": "that should be connected to this delete button in this UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 117.81,
          "end": 121.62,
          "en": "But now this UI should also contain another component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 123.81,
          "en": "that can be displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 123.81,
          "end": 126.99,
          "en": "For that, down here in my return statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 131.61,
          "en": "maybe above that outlet, I'll add the modal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 131.61,
          "end": 134.523,
          "en": "a component that's built into this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 135.72,
          "end": 139.113,
          "en": "You just have to import it from modal JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 140.85,
          "end": 142.32,
          "en": "And I'll move this import up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 142.32,
          "end": 144.003,
          "en": "to the other library imports.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 145.02,
          "end": 147.093,
          "en": "And with modal imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 151.62,
          "en": "we can now show some confirmation text in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 151.62,
          "end": 156.6,
          "en": "For example a title, a H2 title where we ask, are you sure?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 157.44,
          "end": 160.14,
          "en": "And then a paragraph where we may be say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 160.14,
          "end": 164.43,
          "en": "do you really want to delete this event?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 164.43,
          "end": 167.76,
          "en": "This action cannot be undone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 167.76,
          "end": 168.933,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 174.95,
          "en": "And then below that, a div with a class name of form actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 180.4,
          "en": "for formatting and and styling purposes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 181.68,
          "end": 184.89,
          "en": "where I wanna have one button where I'll say cancel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 187.08,
          "en": "and another button where I'll say delete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 187.08,
          "end": 189.063,
          "en": "to confirm this deletion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 191.07,
          "end": 194.4,
          "en": "Now this second button when it's clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 194.4,
          "end": 198.753,
          "en": "should trigger the handle delete function we used before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 199.82999999999998,
          "end": 201.99,
          "en": "And that's this function that contains",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 201.99,
          "end": 203.82,
          "en": "the mutate function call.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 203.82,
          "end": 207.211,
          "en": "So dysfunction which will then actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 207.211,
          "end": 208.593,
          "en": "send that deletion request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 209.61,
          "end": 211.82999999999998,
          "en": "That's the function that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 211.82999999999998,
          "end": 213.993,
          "en": "if this delete button in modal is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 215.07,
          "end": 217.8,
          "en": "If that other button here is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 217.8,
          "end": 221.76,
          "en": "I wanna trigger the handle stop delete function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 221.76,
          "end": 223.66,
          "en": "to close this modal again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 228.15,
          "en": "because this modal should be displayed conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 228.15,
          "end": 231.99,
          "en": "If is deleting is true, I wanna show it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 231.99,
          "end": 234.453,
          "en": "If it's false, I don't wanna show it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 235.86,
          "end": 237.75,
          "en": "so that this really only shows up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 237.75,
          "end": 240.303,
          "en": "if we start that deletion process.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 242.76,
          "end": 245.28,
          "en": "Now this modal component, which I built",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 245.28,
          "end": 249.42,
          "en": "for this application, actually also takes onClose prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 249.42,
          "end": 252.24,
          "en": "which wants a function that should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 253.953,
          "en": "if this modal is closed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 258.03,
          "en": "And here I then wanna stop the deletion of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 258.03,
          "end": 260.55,
          "en": "So I will call handle stop delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 260.55,
          "end": 262.71,
          "en": "so that if we want to close this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 262.71,
          "end": 266.01,
          "en": "we do also close it by updating our state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 266.01,
          "end": 268.533,
          "en": "and exiting out of this deletion state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 270.93,
          "end": 272.58,
          "en": "Now for styling purposes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 272.58,
          "end": 275.97,
          "en": "I'll also add some CSS classes to the buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 275.97,
          "end": 279.75,
          "en": "The cancel button should receive a button dash text clause",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 279.75,
          "end": 283.14300000000003,
          "en": "and the delete button should receive a button clause.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 286.26,
          "end": 288.65999999999997,
          "en": "Now with that, if you save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 288.65999999999997,
          "end": 291.54,
          "en": "if you click delete, this modal opens up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 291.54,
          "end": 294.42,
          "en": "and you can close it by clicking cancel for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 294.42,
          "end": 297.24,
          "en": "But if you click delete, it should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 297.24,
          "end": 299.46,
          "en": "And I'll first create a new event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 299.46,
          "end": 301.29,
          "en": "so that I have a dummy test event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 301.29,
          "end": 303.12,
          "en": "which I can play around with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 303.12,
          "end": 306.36,
          "en": "And I don't delete any of the actual nice data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 306.36,
          "end": 307.863,
          "en": "I prepared for this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 308.76,
          "end": 311.7,
          "en": "But now here I can click delete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 311.7,
          "end": 313.32,
          "en": "If I click delete here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 313.32,
          "end": 316.323,
          "en": "takes a short while and then I'm navigated back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 317.67,
          "end": 319.68,
          "en": "But that's of course also a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 319.68,
          "end": 324.09,
          "en": "Having to wait for this short while is not ideal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.09,
          "end": 326.7,
          "en": "because we wanna give the user some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.7,
          "end": 328.89300000000003,
          "en": "that this deletion was initiated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 330.6,
          "end": 332.7,
          "en": "And of course, as you learnt before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 332.7,
          "end": 335.79,
          "en": "use mutation does not just give you an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 335.79,
          "end": 339.97,
          "en": "with a mutate function, but also pending property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.043,
          "end": 343.86,
          "en": "for example, which tells you whether this deletion request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 343.86,
          "end": 346.383,
          "en": "in this case here is currently on its way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 347.64,
          "end": 350.25,
          "en": "Now since with that I would have a name clash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 350.25,
          "end": 352.8,
          "en": "with is pending from useQuery,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 352.8,
          "end": 355.017,
          "en": "I'll assign a different name to it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 355.017,
          "end": 358.29,
          "en": "by adding a colon here and and then naming this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 358.29,
          "end": 360.58,
          "en": "is pending deletion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 361.71,
          "end": 365.07,
          "en": "and this is standard JavaScript syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 365.07,
          "end": 368.07,
          "en": "where when using object destructuring,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 368.07,
          "end": 370.05,
          "en": "as we're doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 370.05,
          "end": 373.983,
          "en": "you can assign an alias to one of those properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 375.09,
          "end": 376.05,
          "en": "You are pulling out of this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 376.05,
          "end": 379.92,
          "en": "by adding a colon after this original property name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 379.92,
          "end": 381.57,
          "en": "and then adding your new name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 381.57,
          "end": 385.563,
          "en": "under which you'll be able to use it in this file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.63,
          "end": 390.27,
          "en": "So I'm assigning an alias to is pending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 390.27,
          "end": 393.18,
          "en": "and I'll do the same for is error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 393.18,
          "end": 397.98,
          "en": "which I'll name is error deleting, and the error object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 397.98,
          "end": 402.98,
          "en": "which I'll name, delete error or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 405.51,
          "end": 408.51,
          "en": "And now we can use that to also show some loading text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 408.51,
          "end": 410.46,
          "en": "whilst the request is on its way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 410.46,
          "end": 413.823,
          "en": "and some error output if the deletion should fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 414.87,
          "end": 419.7,
          "en": "So going down to our deletion confirmation modal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 419.7,
          "end": 422.31,
          "en": "I for example wanna replace these buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 422.31,
          "end": 423.96,
          "en": "with some loading text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 423.96,
          "end": 427.083,
          "en": "if we are currently performing the deletion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 428.37,
          "end": 433.37,
          "en": "So in here I'll actually check is pending deletion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 433.77,
          "end": 437.34,
          "en": "And if that's the case, I wanna output some paragraph here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 437.34,
          "end": 442.34,
          "en": "where I simply say, deleting, please wait.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 445.08,
          "end": 448.26,
          "en": "On the other hand, if deletion is not pending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 448.26,
          "end": 450,
          "en": "if it's not on its way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 450,
          "end": 453.65999999999997,
          "en": "I wanna output these two buttons wrapped by a fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 453.65999999999997,
          "end": 455.943,
          "en": "since we have two sibling components here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 459.3,
          "end": 460.92,
          "en": "So that should give us some feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 460.92,
          "end": 465.42,
          "en": "about the current loading state of this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 465.42,
          "end": 469.40999999999997,
